      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let it all go\" ... how am i supposed to do that? everyone's expecting me to show up and present. my name is on the grants, my name is on the publications. if I just walk away, it's not just \"pressure,\" it's a total disgrace. i feel like i've already died inside. honestly, it feels more like there's no actual version of my future where things work out after this. it's just a dead end.",
